The files in this directory are generated code (fastddsgen 2.1.4) copied verbatim from
eProsima Fast DDS v2.6.12, commit ac5c7b9014cd5b2bebf9c4b04dc229ca5a0a4338,
path src/cpp/statistics/types/ (source IDL: include/fastdds/statistics/types.idl).

