Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

They are vendored because ROS 2 Humble installs the compiled statistics types in
libfastrtps but ships neither their headers nor fastddsgen. Fast DDS 2.6 serializes
with the fastcdr 1.0 API, so the 2.14 sources cannot be reused. Replace this directory
when targeting a different Fast DDS 2.x version below 2.10.
